# --- data ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The interview recordings, transcriptions and PHQ-9/GAD-7 scores live in a
# sibling data/ directory, outside this repository, and stay there. Nothing
# below this line should ever be committed; the entries are listed anyway so
# that a copy made inside the tree is still caught.
data/
**/UTB_*/

# --- adapted checkpoints -------------------------------------------------
# 15 GB across 24 safetensors files, several above GitHub's 100 MB limit.
# They are also continued-pretraining of public checkpoints on the study's
# own clinical transcripts, so publishing them is a separate decision from
# publishing the code. scripts/run_tsdae.py and scripts/run_mlm_adaptation.py
# rebuild them.
models/

# --- derived artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Feature and embedding caches, wherever they appear: deterministic functions
# of the text, rebuilt in about a minute, and their .ids.txt companions are
# lists of participant identifiers.
**/embeddings/
# Dated workbooks and reports, regenerated by scripts/build_results_workbook.py
results/exports/
archive/*/exports/
# Working copies taken before a migration
results/_backup_*/

# archive/ itself is kept. PROTOCOL.md Section 14 points at it, and the
# five-seed runs under it are the study's only estimate of its own
# seed-to-seed noise -- the figures Sections 10 and 13 quote come from there.
# Only its caches are excluded, by the rule above.

# --- licensed resources --------------------------------------------------
# Stadthagen-Gonzalez valence/arousal and discrete-emotion norms. They are
# supplementary material of their papers and are not redistributable.
# src/affective_norms.py says where to place them.
src/resources/*.csv
src/resources/*.xlsx

# --- python --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
env/
.venv/

# --- editors and os ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- logs ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
